      "html": "† II. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אָוָה</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: assinalar, marcar, descrever por meio de uma marca (</strong>assim Ges (que compara <span dir=\"rtl\">תאה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תוה</span>); Dl<sup>Pr 116 (não W)</sup><strong>)</strong> somente no <br><strong>Hitpael</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְאַוִּיתֶם לָכֶם</span> <em>marcar para vós mesmos, medir</em>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 34:10\" href=\"/Numbers.34.10\">Nu 34:10</a> (P); assim as versões antigas (cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּתָאוּ לָכֶם</span> no versículo <a data-ref=\"Numbers 34:7\" href=\"/Numbers.34.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 34:8\" href=\"/Numbers.34.8\">8</a>; ver, porém, Di e sob <a data-ref=\"BDB, אוה\" href=\"/BDB,_אוה\", dir=\"rtl\">I. אוה</a>).—Ver também [<a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, תָּאַר²\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_תָּאַר²\">תָּאַר</a>] na p. 1061.",
