      "html": "† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹי</span></big></big>  <strong>interjeição</strong> (onomatopeia; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܘܽܝ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܘܳܝ</span>) <strong>ai!</strong> exclamação veemente de pesar e desespero: geralmente com dativo <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹי לִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 6:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.6.5\">Is 6:5</a> <em>ai</em> de mim! porque estou perdido; assim também <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.16\">24:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.19\">Je 10:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.10\">15:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹי לָנוּ</span> <em>ai</em> de nós! <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.7\">1 S 4:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.13\">Je 4:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.4\">6:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹי־נָא לִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:31\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.31\">Je 4:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 45:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.45.3\">45:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹי־נָא לָנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:16\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.16\">La 5:16</a>. Com a 2ª ou a 3ª pessoa, frequentemente implica denúncia; <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹי־לְךָ מוֹאָב</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:29\" href=\"/Numbers.21.29\">Nu 21:29</a> (= <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:46\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.46\">Je 48:46</a>) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:27\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.27\">Je 13:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.23\">Ez 16:23</a> repetido <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹי אוֹי לָךְ</span>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.9\">Is. 3:9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹי לְנַפְשָׁם</span>; ver o versículo <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.11\">11</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:13\" href=\"/Hosea.7.13\">Ho 7:13</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁד לָהֶם</span>) <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:12\" href=\"/Hosea.9.12\">9:12</a>. Com vocativo (ou acusativo implícito) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.6\">Ez 24:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.9\">9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹי עִיר הַדָּמִים</span>; uso absoluto <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:23\" href=\"/Numbers.24.23\">Nu 24:23</a>. Empregado como substantivo <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:29\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.29\">Pr 23:29</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">לִמִי אוֹי</span> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">לְמִי אֲבוֹי</span>).",
