      "html": "† II. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אִי</span>]</big>  <strong>substantivo masculino: chacal (</strong><em>uivador</em>; em lugar de* <span dir=\"rtl\">אָוִי</span>; ver Ba<sup>NB 188</sup>; cf. árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">اِبْنُ آوَى</span>; de onde a forma siríaca <span dir=\"rtl\">ܒ̈</span><span dir=\"rtl\">ܢܳܬ ܐܰܘܰܝ</span> <strong>)</strong>—plural <span dir=\"rtl\">אִיִּים</span>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.22\">Is 13:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.14\">34:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:39\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.39\">Je 50:39</a> (habitante do deserto, das ruínas).",
