      "html": "† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַיָּה</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino (</strong><em>falcão</em><strong>) </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  um horeu <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:24\" href=\"/Genesis.36.24\">Gn 36:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:40\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.40\">1 Ch 1:40</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  pai de Rispa <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.7\">2 S 3:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:8\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.8\">21:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:11\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.11\">11</a>.",
