      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֱוִיל</span></big><sub>26</sub>  <strong>adjetivo: insensato</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 5:2\" href=\"/Job.5.2\">Jb 5:2</a> +; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱוִילִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:17\" href=\"/Psalms.107.17\">ψ 107:17</a> + etc.;—<em>insensato</em>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.9\">Pr 29:9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אִישׁ א׳)</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:7\" href=\"/Hosea.9.7\">Ho 9:7</a> (predicado acerca do profeta); cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.8\">Is 35:8</a>; em outros lugares, <strong>substantivo masculino: insensato</strong> (sempre em sentido moral negativo), que despreza a sabedoria e a disciplina <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.7\">Pr 1:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.5\">15:5</a>; zomba da culpa <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.9\">14:9</a>; é briguento <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.3\">20:3</a>; licencioso <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.22\">7:22</a>; é insensatez e inútil instruí-lo <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.22\">16:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.22\">27:22</a> (19 ocorrências em Provérbios); cf. também <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.22\">Je 4:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 5:2\" href=\"/Job.5.2\">Jb 5:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 5:3\" href=\"/Job.5.3\">3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.19.11\">Is 19:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:17\" href=\"/Psalms.107.17\">ψ 107:17</a>.",
