      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">אִוֶּ֫לֶת</span></big><sub>25</sub>  <strong>substantivo feminino: insensatez</strong>—estado absoluto <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.23\">Pr 12:23</a> +; estado construto <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.8\">14:8</a> +; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">אִוַּלְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:6\" href=\"/Psalms.38.6\">ψ 38:6</a> etc.;—<em>insensatez</em>, produto característico dos <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּסִילִים</span> (ver <a data-ref=\"BDB, כֶּ֫סֶל\" href=\"/BDB,_כֶּ֫סֶל\", dir=\"rtl\">כֶּסֶל</a>) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.23\">Pr 12:23</a> + (12 ocorrências); com <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּתָאִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.18\">Pr 14:18</a>; com <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱוִלִים</span> somente em <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.22\">16:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.22\">27:22</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.24\">14:24</a>) por aliteração. Está arraigada no espírito do menino e só pode ser removida pela vara da disciplina <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.15\">Pr 22:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> personificada derruba a casa edificada pela <span dir=\"rtl\">חַכְמוֹת נָשִׁים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.1\">Pr 14:1</a>; contrapõe-se a <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:29\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.29\">Pr 14:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.21\">15:21</a>.",
