      "html": "† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אוּלָם</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino</strong> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.8\">1 K 7:8</a> <strong>pórtico</strong> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֵילָם\" href=\"/BDB,_אֵילָם\", dir=\"rtl\">אֵילָם</a>)—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> estado absoluto <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.3\">1 K 6:3</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֻלָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:48\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.48\">Ez 40:48</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:49\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.49\">49</a>; estado construto <span dir=\"rtl\">אוּלָם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:6\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.6\">1 K 7:6</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֻלָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.7\">Ez 40:7</a> + (à margem <span dir=\"rtl\">אֻלָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.7\">1 K 7:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:21\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.21\">21</a>); plural no estado construto <span dir=\"rtl\">אֻלַמֵּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.15\">Ez 41:15</a> (Co propõe singular com sufixo; em Ezequiel, Co lê em todas as passagens <span dir=\"rtl\">אילם</span>; ver <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֵילָם\" href=\"/BDB,_אֵילָם\", dir=\"rtl\">אֵילָם</a> abaixo)—<em>pórtico</em> (somente em Reis, Crônicas, Ezequiel e Joel).<br><strong>1.</strong>  no templo de Salomão <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:19\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.19\">1 K 7:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.7\">2 Ch 29:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ יהוה</span>; ver o versículo <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.17\">17</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 8:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.8.12\">8:12</a> (com o altar à frente); <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ יהוה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.8\">15:8</a> (<em>idem</em>); cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּין הָאוּלָם וּבֵין הַמִּזְבֵּחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.16\">Ez 8:16</a> & <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:17\" href=\"/Joel.2.17\">Jo 2:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ הַהֵיכָל</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:21\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.21\">1 K 7:21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ הַבַּיִת</span>; ver o versículo <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.12\">12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּבְנִית הָא׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.11\">1 Ch 28:11</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  no palácio de Salomão <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.8\">1 K 7:8</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ הָעַמּוּדִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:6\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.6\">1 K 7:6</a>; cf. versículo <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:6\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.6\">6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ הַכִּסֵּא</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.7\">7:7</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ הַמִּשְׁפָּט</span>; ver o versículo <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.7\">7</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  no templo da visão de Ezequiel, especialmente <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ הַשַּׁעַר</span>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.7\">Ez 40:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.8\">8</a> (Co suprime; ver 𝔊, 𝔖 e 𝔙) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.9\">9</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:39\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.39\">39</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:40\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.40\">40</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.3\">44:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 46:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.46.2\">46:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 46:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.46.8\">8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ הַבַּיִת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:48\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.48\">40:48</a>; cf. versículo <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:48\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.48\">48</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:49\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.49\">49</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.25\">41:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:26\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.26\">26</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֻלַמֵּי הֶחָצֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.15\">Ez 41:15</a>; Co propõe singular <span dir=\"rtl\">ואילמו החיצון</span>; ver <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, אֵילָם\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_אֵילָם\">אֵילָם</a>.—(III. <span dir=\"rtl\">אוּלָם</span>, advérbio; ver p. 19.)",
