      "html": "II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַ֫יִל</span></big>  <strong>substantivo</strong>[<strong>masculino</strong>] <strong>pilar saliente</strong> ou <strong>pilastra</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> estado absoluto <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:31\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.31\">1 K 6:31</a> (mas ver abaixo); estado construto <em>idem</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.14\">Ez 40:14</a> (Co, porém, suprime) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.16\">16</a> (Co considera melhor <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילָיו</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵיל</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.3\">41:3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:48\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.48\">40:48</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.14\">40:14</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.10\">40:10</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">אילו</span> ketiv <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.9\">40:9</a> + 7 ocorrências; <span dir=\"rtl\">אלו</span> ketiv <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:29\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.29\">40:29</a> + 2 ocorrências; qerê (em todas) <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילָיו</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵלָיו</span>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵלֵיהֵמָֿה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.16\">40:16</a>;—<em>pilastra</em> ou saliência da parede em cada lado de uma entrada (cf. Bö<sup>Proben, 302; NÄ 927</sup>); no templo de Salomão <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:31\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.31\">1 K 6:31</a> (Bö<sup>NÄ 525</sup> lê <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילָם</span>); no templo de Ezequiel <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.9\">Ez 40:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.10\">10</a> + 14 ocorrências <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40\">Ez 40</a>.<a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41\">41</a> + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.14\">40:14a</a>; Ew, Hi e Co <span dir=\"rtl\">אילם</span>; cf. 𝔊B; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:38\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.38\">40:38</a>; ler <span dir=\"rtl\">אילם</span> assim Sm e Co, cf. 𝔊; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.14\">40:14b</a> Co suprime <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span>.",
