      "html": "† III. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אַ֫יִל</span> ?]</big>  <strong>substantivo masculino: líder, chefe (</strong>= carneiro, como chefe do rebanho? cf. Di <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:15\" href=\"/Exodus.15.15\">Ex 15:15</a>; Ol<sup>§ 142 f</sup>; Lag<sup>BN 170</sup>; ver <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.17\">Ez 34:17</a><strong>)</strong>—estado construto <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.11\">Ez 31:11</a>; plural no estado construto <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:15\" href=\"/Exodus.15.15\">Ex 15:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.13\">Ez 17:13</a>; + <a data-ref=\"II Kings 24:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.24.15\">2 K 24:15</a> qerê (ketiv <span dir=\"rtl\">אולי</span>; ver <a data-ref=\"BDB, אוּל²\" href=\"/BDB,_אוּל²\", dir=\"rtl\">אוּל</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵלֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.21\">Ez 32:21</a> (Co suprime; ver 𝔊).—<em>líder, chefe</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ מוֹאָב</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:15\" href=\"/Exodus.15.15\">Ex 15:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ הָאָרֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.13\">Ez 17:13</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 24:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.24.15\">2 K 24:15</a> qerê; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ גּוֹיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.11\">Ez 31:11</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">אֵלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 41:17\" href=\"/Job.41.17\">Jb 41:17</a>; ver sob I. -<a data-ref=\"BDB, אלה\" href=\"/BDB,_אלה\", dir=\"rtl\">אלה</a>; talvez <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵלֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.14\">Ez 31:14</a>; mas cf. abaixo IV. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אַ֫יִל⁴\" href=\"/BDB,_אַ֫יִל⁴\", dir=\"rtl\">איל</a> e também <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> nota 1).",
