      "html": "† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֵלָה</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino (</strong><em>terebinto</em>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:21\" href=\"/Genesis.49.21\">Gn 49:21</a> sob I. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֵלָה\" href=\"/BDB,_אֵלָה\", dir=\"rtl\">אֵלָה</a><strong>) </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  um chefe de Edom <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:41\" href=\"/Genesis.36.41\">Gn 36:41</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:52\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.52\">1 Ch 1:52</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילַת</span> <strong>nome próprio de lugar</strong>? ver Di);<br><strong>2.</strong>  filho de Baasa; reinou dois anos em Israel <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:6\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.6\">1 K 16:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:13\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:14\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.14\">14</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  pai de Oseias, último rei de Israel <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:30\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.30\">2 K 15:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 17:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.17.1\">17:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.1\">18:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.9\">9</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  filho de Calebe <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.15\">1 Ch 4:15</a><sup>(×2)</sup>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  filho de Uzi <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.8\">1 Ch 9:8</a>.",
