      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַיָּלָה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino: corça, fêmea do cervo</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span>; estado absoluto <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:21\" href=\"/Genesis.49.21\">Gn 49:21</a> (mas deve-se ler <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילָה</span>; ver abaixo); <span dir=\"rtl\">אַיֶּ֫לֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.5\">Je 14:5</a>; estado construto <span dir=\"rtl\">אַיֶּ֫לֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:1\" href=\"/Psalms.22.1\">ψ 22:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.19\">Pr 5:19</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">אַיָּלוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 29:9\" href=\"/Psalms.29.9\">ψ 29:9</a> + 4 ocorrências; estado construto <span dir=\"rtl\">אַיְלוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:7\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.7\">Ct 2:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 3:5\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.3.5\">3:5</a>—<em>corça</em>, ao dar à luz <a data-ref=\"Job 39:1\" href=\"/Job.39.1\">Jb 39:1</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">חֹלֵל א׳</span> ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶדֶת יַעֲלֵי סָ֑לַע</span>); cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 29:9\" href=\"/Psalms.29.9\">ψ 29:9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹל יָ׳ יְחוֹלֵל א׳</span>; numa fórmula de adjuração <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּצְבָאוֹת אוֹ בְּא׳ הַשָּׂדֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:7\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.7\">Ct 2:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 3:5\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.3.5\">3:5</a>; em comparação <span dir=\"rtl\">מְשַׁיֶּה רַגְלַי כָּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:34\" href=\"/Psalms.18.34\">ψ 18:34</a>; = <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:34\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.34\">2 S 22:34</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּשֶׂם ר׳ כָּא׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:19\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.19\">Hb 3:19</a>; isto é, de passo firme e seguro; cf. o paralelismo com <span dir=\"rtl\">וְעַל בָּמֹתַי יַעֲמִידֵנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:34\" href=\"/Psalms.18.34\">ψ 18:34</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:34\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.34\">2 S 22:34</a>; assim também <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:19\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.19\">Hb 3:19</a>; mas com o verbo <span dir=\"rtl\">יַדְרִכֵנִי</span>; metaforicamente, acerca de Naftali <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:21\" href=\"/Genesis.49.21\">Gn 49:21</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ שְׁלֻחָה</span>; mas deve-se ler <span dir=\"rtl\">אִילָה</span>; cf. sob I. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֵלָה\" href=\"/BDB,_אֵלָה\", dir=\"rtl\">אֵלָה</a>; no título de uma melodia <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:1\" href=\"/Psalms.22.1\">ψ 22:1</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל־אַיֶּלֶת הַשַּׁחַר</span>; cf. De; e para a corça como imagem da aurora, <em>Yom.</em><sup>29a</sup>.",
