      "ref": "BDB, אוּלָם⁴",
      "preview": "אוּלָם⁴: tradução portuguesa integral; 20 referências documentais preservadas.",
      "html": "† III. <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">אוּלָם</span></big></big>  e (<a data-ref=\"Job 17:10\" href=\"/Job.17.10\">Jb 17:10</a>; talvez pela assonância com o seguinte <span dir=\"rtl\">כֻּלָּם</span>) <span dir=\"rtl\">אֻלָּם</span> <strong>advérbio: mas, mas de fato</strong>; adversativa enfática <a data-ref=\"Job 2:5\" href=\"/Job.2.5\">Jb 2:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 5:8\" href=\"/Job.5.8\">5:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 13:3\" href=\"/Job.13.3\">13:3</a> (onde 𝔊 emprega apropriadamente οὐ μὴν δὲ ἀλλά). Mais frequentemente com <span dir=\"rtl\">וְ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְאוּלָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 28:19\" href=\"/Genesis.28.19\">Gn 28:19</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:29\" href=\"/Judges.18.29\">Ju 18:29</a>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 48:19\" href=\"/Genesis.48.19\">48:19</a> <em>todavia</em> seu irmão mais novo será maior que ele; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:16\" href=\"/Exodus.9.16\">Ex 9:16</a> <em>mas, em verdade</em>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:21\" href=\"/Numbers.14.21\">Nu 14:21</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.3\">1 S 20:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:34\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.34\">25:34</a>) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 20:23\" href=\"/I_Kings.20.23\">1 K 20:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Micah 3:8\" href=\"/Micah.3.8\">Mic 3:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 1:11\" href=\"/Job.1.11\">Jb 1:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 11:5\" href=\"/Job.11.5\">11:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 12:7\" href=\"/Job.12.7\">12:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 13:4\" href=\"/Job.13.4\">13:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 14:18\" href=\"/Job.14.18\">14:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 17:10\" href=\"/Job.17.10\">17:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 33:1\" href=\"/Job.33.1\">33:1</a>.",
