      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אוּץ</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: pressionar, ser pressionado, apressar-se</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">אָץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:13\" href=\"/Joshua.10.13\">Jos 10:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 17:15\" href=\"/Joshua.17.15\">17:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אַ֫צְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.16\">Je 17:16</a>; particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">אָץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.2\">Pr 19:2</a> + 3 ocorrências em Provérbios; <span dir=\"rtl\">אָצִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 5:13\" href=\"/Exodus.5.13\">Ex 5:13</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>pressionar, apressar</em> (transitivo, mas com objeto não expresso) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 5:13\" href=\"/Exodus.5.13\">Ex 5:13</a> (E). <strong>2.</strong>  (intransitivo) <em>ser pressionado, comprimido, estreito</em> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 17:15\" href=\"/Joshua.17.15\">Jos 17:15</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּי אָץ לְךָ הַר־אֶפְרַיִם</span>. <strong>3.</strong>  <em>apressar-se, agir depressa</em>; seguido de ל + infinitivo <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:13\" href=\"/Joshua.10.13\">Jos 10:13</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">לֹא אָץ לָבוֹא</span> (J, acerca do sol); <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.20\">Pr 28:20</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ לַהַעֲשִׁיר</span>; seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.16\">Je 17:16</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">לֹא א׳ מֵרוֹעֶה</span>; seguido de ב (indicando aquilo em que se apressa) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.2\">Pr 19:2</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(בַּרַגְלַיִם)</span>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.20\">29:20</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(בִּדַבָרִים)</span>; cf. também <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.5\">Pr 21:5</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וַכָל־אָץ אַךְ לַמַחַסוֹר</span>.<br><strong>Hifil</strong>  imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּאִיצוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:15\" href=\"/Genesis.19.15\">Gn 19:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּאִיצוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.4\">Is 22:4</a>—<em>apressar</em> (transitivo); seguido de ב <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:15\" href=\"/Genesis.19.15\">Gn 19:15</a> (J); seguido de ל + infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">אַל־תָּא׳ לְנַחֲמֵנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.4\">Is 22:4</a>. (Pode ser imperfeito do Qal e verbo <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳י</span>.)",
