      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹר</span></big><sub>121</sub>  <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹר</span></big><sub>121</sub> <strong>feminino</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Job 36:32\" href=\"/Job.36.32\">Jb 36:32</a></sup>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.16\">Je 13:16</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:3\" href=\"/Genesis.1.3\">Gn 1:3</a> <strong>luz (</strong>assírio <em>urru</em> = <em>ûru</em>; Dl<sup>W</sup><strong>)</strong>—estado absoluto <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:3\" href=\"/Genesis.1.3\">Gn 1:3</a> +; estado construto <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:2\" href=\"/Judges.16.2\">Ju 16:2</a> +; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 27:1\" href=\"/Psalms.27.1\">ψ 27:1</a> etc.; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 136:7\" href=\"/Psalms.136.7\">ψ 136:7</a>;—<br/><br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>luz</em> difundida na natureza, luz do dia <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:3\" href=\"/Genesis.1.3\">Gn 1:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:4\" href=\"/Genesis.1.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:5\" href=\"/Genesis.1.5\">5</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Job 3:9\" href=\"/Job.3.9\">Jb 3:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 38:19\" href=\"/Job.38.19\">38:19</a> +.<br/><br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>luz da manhã, aurora</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹר הַבֹּקֶר</span> luz da manhã <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:2\" href=\"/Judges.16.2\">Ju 16:2</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:36\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.36\">1 S 14:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:34\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.34\">25:34</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:36\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.36\">36</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:22\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.22\">2 S 17:22</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 7:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.7.9\">2 K 7:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Micah 2:1\" href=\"/Micah.2.1\">Mi 2:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ בֹּקֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.4\">2 S 23:4</a> (poema de Davi); <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד־הָא׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:26\" href=\"/Judges.19.26\">Ju 19:26</a> (cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד־הַבֹּקֶר</span> o versículo <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:25\" href=\"/Judges.19.25\">25</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">לָאוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 24:14\" href=\"/Job.24.14\">Jb 24:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן־הָאוֹר עַד מַחֲצִית הַיּוֹם</span> desde a <em>aurora até o meio-dia</em>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.3\">Ne 8:3</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.18\">Pr 4:18</a>.<br/><br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>luz</em> dos luminares celestes; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ הַלְּבָנָה</span>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ הַחַמָּה</span> <em>luar</em> & <em>luz solar</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.26\">Is 30:26</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כּוֹכְבֵי אוֹר</span> <em>estrelas luminosas</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 148:3\" href=\"/Psalms.148.3\">ψ 148:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מְאוֹרֵי אוֹר</span> <em>luminares luminosos</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.8\">Ez 32:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹרִים</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">מְאוֹרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 136:7\" href=\"/Psalms.136.7\">ψ 136:7</a>; assim também <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲלֵי־אוֹר</span> <em>à luz do sol</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 18:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.18.4\">Is 18:4</a>; o próprio sol <a data-ref=\"Job 31:26\" href=\"/Job.31.26\">Jb 31:26</a>.<br/><br><strong>4.</strong>  <em>luz do dia</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹר רְשָׁעִים</span> <em>luz dos ímpios</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 38:15\" href=\"/Job.38.15\">Jb 38:15</a> (pois seu período de atividade é a noite); <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם אוֹר</span> <em>um dia de luz</em> <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:9\" href=\"/Amos.8.9\">Am 8:9</a> (= dia claro e ensolarado).<br/><br><strong>5.</strong>  <em>relâmpago</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 36:32\" href=\"/Job.36.32\">Jb 36:32</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 37:3\" href=\"/Job.37.3\">37:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 37:11\" href=\"/Job.37.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 37:15\" href=\"/Job.37.15\">15</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:11\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.11\">Hb 3:11</a>.<br/><br><strong>6.</strong>  <em>luz</em> de uma lâmpada <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.9\">Pr 13:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.10\">Je 25:10</a>; do hálito quente do crocodilo <a data-ref=\"Job 41:10\" href=\"/Job.41.10\">Jb 41:10</a>.<br/><br><strong>7.</strong>  <em>luz da vida</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ חַיִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 33:30\" href=\"/Job.33.30\">Jb 33:30</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 56:14\" href=\"/Psalms.56.14\">ψ 56:14</a>; cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, אוֹר²\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_אוֹר²\">אוֹר</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 3:16\" href=\"/Job.3.16\">Jb 3:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 3:20\" href=\"/Job.3.20\">20</a>.<br/><br><strong>8.</strong>  <em>luz da prosperidade</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 22:28\" href=\"/Job.22.28\">Jb 22:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 30:26\" href=\"/Job.30.26\">30:26</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 97:11\" href=\"/Psalms.97.11\">ψ 97:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:2\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.2\">La 3:2</a>.<br/><br><strong>9.</strong>  <em>luz da instrução</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">נֵר מִצְוָה וְתוֹרָה אוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.23\">Pr 6:23</a> <em>o mandamento</em> é <em>lâmpada, e a instrução, luz;</em> assim o servo messiânico é <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹר גּוֹיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.6\">Is 42:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.6\">49:6</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ עַמִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.4\">Is 51:4</a>; o advento do Messias é o resplandecer de grande luz <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.1\">Is 9:1</a><sup>(×2)</sup>.<br><strong>10.</strong>  <em>luz</em> do rosto <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹר פָּנִים</span> = rosto luminoso e alegre (de homens) <a data-ref=\"Job 29:24\" href=\"/Job.29.24\">Jb 29:24</a>; que indica o favor do rei <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.15\">Pr 16:15</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עֵינַ֫יִם\" href=\"/BDB,_עֵינַ֫יִם\", dir=\"rtl\">א׳ עֵינַיִם</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:11\" href=\"/Psalms.38.11\">ψ 38:11</a>); quanto a Deus, seu rosto resplandecente, que ilumina e concede favor <a data-ref=\"Psalms 4:7\" href=\"/Psalms.4.7\">ψ 4:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:4\" href=\"/Psalms.44.4\">44:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:16\" href=\"/Psalms.89.16\">89:16</a>.<br><strong>11.</strong>  YHWH é <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ יִשְׂרָאֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.17\">Is 10:17</a> como fonte de iluminação e prosperidade; luz e salvação <a data-ref=\"Psalms 27:1\" href=\"/Psalms.27.1\">ψ 27:1</a>; luz para guiar <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:8\" href=\"/Micah.7.8\">Mi 7:8</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 43:3\" href=\"/Psalms.43.3\">ψ 43:3</a>; luz eterna de Sião, no lugar do sol e da lua <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.19\">Is 60:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.20\">20</a>; a casa de Jacó deve andar na sua luz <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.2.5\">Is 2:5</a>.",
